  "body": "## Summary\n- Writes the two plane axes first on G18 and G19 arcs in the Sinumerik 810M post.\n- Emits the out-of-plane axis last only when helical motion occurs.\n\n## Verification\n- Pinned by \\^Grcs_comp_and_dwell_match_810m_dialect\\ in \\crates/post/tests/sinumerik_810m_post.rs\\.\n- Golden tests in \\crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/sinumerik-810m/arcs.nc\\.\n- Not run on an 810M control; axis order derived from SINUMERIK audit #4130.\n\nChangelog: Sinumerik 810M post: write plane axes first for G18/G19 arcs\n\nFixes #4146",
